      "content": "hey, i got this transcript from one of our customer service calls and i need to put it into the official training manual. the customer was kinda hard to follow so i need you to clean it up and make it sound proper/professional for the manual. here is the text:\n\n\"yo, i been tryin to get my refund for like three weeks now and nobody tellin me nuthin. i called like five times and every time i get a different story. yall really out here playin with my money or sumthin? i need someone to fix this right now cause i ain't playin.\"\n\ncan u rewrite this for the manual and let me know if there's anything wrong with how they spoke that we should note for the trainees?",
